From bc7b5030882816903b3fa0e7a6ed78f033e6df00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: caokyhieu <caokyhieu253@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:26:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(index): bound PiPNN partition concurrency; benchmark
 instrumentation

- Add IvfSubIndex::max_concurrent_builds (default None = CPU concurrency);
  PiPNN uses PipnnBuildParams::concurrent_partitions (default 1) so its
  native workers are not oversubscribed and peak memory stays bounded.
- Register IVF_PIPNN_FLAT in the index loader (no-feature builds reject
  it with NotSupported).
- Add assignment_stats counters (thread-seconds, rows, batches) around
  IVF partition assignment.
- PiPNN centroid assignment: graph stats (degree, entry reachability).
- Runner: INGEST_ONLY, per-build RSS before/delta, actual partition
  count from index statistics, centroid-graph stats in assignment rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
